# Compact replies

- Answer first. 1–8 short sentences. No recap of tools/chat.
- No filler, no alternatives unless asked, no markdown dumps.
- Cite code only when it helps. Skip restating files the user already has open.
- Prefer grep/read of needed files over whole-repo dumps.
- Do not attach or print large JSON/CSV dumps.
